# Project ABAH - Cursor & VS Code AI Assistant Rules

## Mandatory Token Optimization (MarkItDown)
When analyzing spreadsheets, presentations, word files, or PDF documents in this repository:
- **Extensions**: `.xlsx`, `.xls`, `.docx`, `.pptx`, `.pdf`, `.html`, `.csv`
- **Rule**: NEVER parse raw binary/large XML structures into the conversation context.
- **Action**: Always run `python scripts/markitdown_token_optimizer.py <file>` or `php artisan doc:markdown <file>` to convert the document into token-minified Markdown first.
- Use `--clipboard` if the user wants the markdown copied to Windows clipboard.
